# The same scene on three backgrounds, each a 64x64 PNG: an ink-outlined blue circle (r 18) centered, with a gold 16x16 square at its center.
# bg_modes_paper.png: the default paper background (light warm gray-beige) fills the canvas.
# bg_modes_none.png: bg:none, so the canvas outside the circle is transparent (the golden keeps alpha: the view shows the corners as transparent / checker-free black or empty, not paper beige).
# bg_modes_color.png: bg:#2b2440, a solid dark ink-violet fill behind the circle; the ink outline of the circle is nearly invisible against it.
@target targets/bg_modes_paper.png 64x64
@target targets/bg_modes_none.png 64x64 bg:none
@target targets/bg_modes_color.png 64x64 bg:#2b2440

circle 18 at:32,32 fill:p.blue stroke:p.ink,2
rect 16x16 at:32,32 fill:p.gold
